# Review severity & merge policy

Prefix every blocking review comment with a tag:

| Tag | Mergeable? | Meaning |
| ------------ | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------- |
| `[CRITICAL]` | **No** | Production integrity, security, data loss |
| `[HIGH]` | **No** | Architecture violation, untested core logic |
| `[MED]` | Fix or ticket + sign-off | Maintainability, non-critical test gaps |
| `[NIT]` | Yes | Optional polish |
| `[FYI]` | Yes | Informational |

Loop while `critical + high + med > 0` (exact policy is team choice; be consistent).

## Compressed review format (optional)

For high-volume agent or human review, one line per finding:

```
path:line: severity: problem. fix.
```

Severity emoji optional: bug / risk / nit / question. Parent paraphrases for humans; machines consume the contract.

